POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/rewards
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Reward 102 (Cart 미포함)", "description": "-", "price": 10000, "totalQuantity": 10}

> {% client.global.set("reward102", response.body.data.rewardId); %}

### 9. 리워드 103 역할 — 역시 Cart에는 담지 않는다
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/projects/{{projectId}}/rewards
Authorization: Bearer {{creatorAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Reward 103 (Cart 미포함)", "description": "-", "price": 10000, "totalQuantity": 10}

> {% client.global.set("reward103", response.body.data.rewardId); %}

